{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36612","headline":"上鄂州韦尚书 · 罗隐","name":"上鄂州韦尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往岁先皇驭九州，侍臣才业最风流。\n文穷典诰虽余力，俗致雍熙尽密谋。\n兰省换班青作绶，柏台前引绦爲韝。\n都缘未负江山兴，开济生灵校一秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36612.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36612","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}